    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "detail_content",
      "x": 800, "y": 390,
      "width": 460, "height": 300,
      "text": "Repeats code once for each item\nin a list.\n\nSYNTAX:\n  for item in my_list:\n      <do something with item>\n\nEXAMPLE:\n  broken = get_broken_sectors()\n  for sector in broken:\n      repair(sector)\n\nWATCH OUT:\n  * Indented block runs per item\n  * Code after loop runs once",
      "originalText": "Repeats code once for each item\nin a list.\n\nSYNTAX:\n  for item in my_list:\n      <do something with item>\n\nEXAMPLE:\n  broken = get_broken_sectors()\n  for sector in broken:\n      repair(sector)\n\nWATCH OUT:\n  * Indented block runs per item\n  * Code after loop runs once",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#93c5fd",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
